{"product_id":"restless","title":"Restless","description":"\u003cp\u003eIn this absorbing historical thriller . . . Sally Gilmartin, born Eva Delectorskaya, a Russian emigree recruited into the British Secret Service in 1939, reveals her clandestine past in an autobiography that she gives to her daughter, Ruth, a graduate student and single mother living a dull civilian life in Oxford in 1976.--\"The New Yorker.\"\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: William Boyd\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780747586203\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 336\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 128 x 192\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41763038232729,"sku":"16RC-2-9780747586203","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/restless-620597.jpg?v=1694791257","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/restless","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}